# README

## Installation Steps

Download the project files

Make sure Python 3.6 or later is installed on your system. You can download it from [python.org](https://www.python.org/downloads/).

Run below to install all dependencies required
```bash
pip install pytest simpy psycopg2 flask matplotlib numpy
```

## Running the Application

Open a terminal

Navigate to the project's root directory

Run the application

```bash
python app.py
```

Once the application is running, you can access it by this link
```
http://127.0.0.1:5000/
```
